target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:38626f76-054d-474f-9700-96504fc79ca3\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira%27s_Basement\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Jaheira's Basement\">Jaheira's Basement</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1557&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;989</span></li>\n<li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn_-_Cellar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Last Light Inn - Cellar\">Last Light Inn - Cellar</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;8&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-737</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>The Harpers are a secret organisation whose main purpose is the preservation of all things good and right in the world. They outfox evil at every turn, with shrewd fighting or cunning political manoeuvre, and though they are not well organised (how could they be, with many members utterly ignorant of the identity of those they might claim as allies?), they are united in purpose and goal. One Harper agent deployed correctly in a conflict often achieves the same results as a loosed army.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715070616\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1613/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29322/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7834/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoop